(text "Two AL8860 constant-current buck channels from a 24 V adapter. 333 mA per channel (0.1 V / 0.30 ohm).\nEach channel drives one off-board string of 4 LEDs on a star heatsink: blue 450 nm on J3, red 660 nm on J4.\nJ2 takes the sensor node's PWM (3.3 V logic, 250 Hz). CTRL above 2.5 V = full current, below 0.2 V = off;\nthe 2.2k pull-downs keep the LEDs off when J2 is unplugged or the node is in reset.\nJ1: centre-positive 24 V barrel jack. F1 + D1 protect against overload and a reversed adapter." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7c282233-c7d7-566b-8299-19f0e1aedf8d"))
